      "title": "Issue of authorisation for Repeat Orders of SCOMET item(s)",
      "chapterNumber": "10",
      "authority": "DGFT",
      "timeline": "However, in cases of repeat orders for export of same SCOMET item to different country/entities approval will be grante…",
